    "description": "Angel Studios is not just another streaming service. Our shows, movies, comedy specials, and documentaries are handpicked by our biggest supporters and fans, Angel Guild members.  We\u2019re taking the power back from Hollywood gatekeepers and giving it to you.\r\n\r\nWatch inspiring and award-winning content on Angel Studios, from original series like The Wingfeather Saga to movies such as Sound of Freedom and His Only Son, and unique comedy shows like Dry Bar Comedy. New episodes and titles are added monthly, with 370+ movies, episodes, and stand up comedy specials ready for you to enjoy today.\r\n\r\nAngel Studios offers exceptional entertainment for all ages, but it\u2019s so much more than that: Our Angel Guild membership allows you to take an insider role in the film and TV industry. When you join the Angel Guild, you not only enjoy unlimited access to our award-winning, viewer-supported content, including exclusive early access to every new release; you also get to vote for new content, receive merch discounts, and support us in building a library designed to inspire, uplift, and unite through meaningful storytelling. \r\n\r\nExperience an entertainment movement that\u2019s breaking barriers. Angel Studios is full of high-quality, value-driven TV entertainment you can\u2019t watch anywhere else. Want to support your favorite content? Join the Angel Guild, Pay it Forward, buy merchandise, or even invest in our projects\u2019 success. We can do nothing without your support. \r\n\r\nAngel Studios believes in making storytelling universally accessible. Our commitment to share light-amplifying content allows us to offer much of our library for free and so much more to Guild members.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Watch 370+ movies, TV show episodes, comedy specials and documentaries\r\n\u2022 Enjoy over 80% of our library for free (new releases are always available exclusively to Guild members first)\r\n\u2022 Decide the next show we release and stream instead 